  <text x="50" y="170" fill="#333" font-size="14" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">自北向南：众智园AI自主创新加速区(192.1ha)、北京AI原点社区(104.3ha)、大钟寺AI产业聚集区(72.0ha)。每处重点区域包含产业功能、建筑形态、公共空间、交通组织和AI场景。</text>
  <text x="50" y="190" fill="#666" font-size="12" font-family="sans-serif">From north to south: Zhongzhiyuan AI Acceleration Area (192.1ha), Beijing AI Origin Community (104.3ha), Dazhongsi AI Industry Cluster (72.0ha).</text>
